      "cell": [
        5,
        -3
      ],
      "data": 12,
      "samples": 2,
      "lore_en": "The observatory archive contains a chart of the broken network. Its final record reads: 'First, learn to listen.' The next node lies farther down the slope."
    },
    {
      "id": "find_1",
      "name_en": "Luminous colony",
      "sector": 0,
      "cell": [
        -5,
        -4
      ],
      "data": 12,
      "samples": 2,
      "lore_en": "The colony flashes at regular intervals. A working drill disrupts its rhythm, which returns when the drill stops. Machinery influences the observed signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "find_2",
      "name_en": "Black box",
      "sector": 0,
      "cell": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "data": 12,
      "samples": 2,
      "lore_en": "The black box recorded identical pulses before the uplink failed. The sequence repeats every seventeen seconds. Its source was deeper than the station."
    },
    {
      "id": "find_3",
      "name_en": "Silica skeleton",
      "sector": 0,
      "cell": [
        -4,
        5
      ],
      "data": 12,
      "samples": 2,
      "lore_en": "The hollow skeleton amplifies low frequencies. Old hydrophones show the same profile. Natural structures may carry the signal over long distances."
    },
    {
      "id": "find_4",
      "name_en": "Old seabed cable",
      "sector": 1,
      "cell": [
        7,
        2
      ],
      "data": 18,
      "samples": 3,
      "lore_en": "The old cable is intact but was disconnected manually. A service message warns: 'Transmission interferes with measurement.' Further work needs a separate quiet outpost."
    },
    {
      "id": "find_5",
      "name_en": "Singing sponge",
      "sector": 1,
      "cell": [
        5,
        -3
      ],
      "data": 18,
      "samples": 3,
      "lore_en": "The sponge responds to pulses out of phase. A group can suppress surrounding noise. This observation will inform acoustic screens."
    },
    {
      "id": "find_6",
      "name_en": "Sunken probe",
      "sector": 1,
      "cell": [
        -5,
        -4
      ],
      "data": 18,
      "samples": 3,
      "lore_en": "The probe retained accurate pressure readings. Its clock was correct: intermediate reflections caused the delay. The distant signal follows a complex route."
    },
    {
