      "sector": 1,
      "cell": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "data": 18,
      "samples": 3,
      "lore_en": "The expedition stopped active scanning after detecting a stable response. Researchers switched to passive sensors. Their journal charts a hydrothermal field."
    },
